#: includes/Module/HotelSelectionModule.php:308
msgid ""
"Amount added per additional person beyond the first. Used when no price "
"matrix or explicit 1-/2-person price matches the selected persons count. "
"Persons selector visibility is controlled by the product min/max persons "
"range."
